      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding \"demographic volatility\"—do you think we should include specific metrics like high rates of migration, changes in ethnic composition, or language diversity in certain sectors? I want to make sure the model captures where social tensions are most likely to flare up based on shifts in the community makeup.",
